Files (128px PNG), renamed from their Unicode codepoint to the app's own
mood/tone label:
  positive.png     <- emoji_u1f60a.png (smiling face with smiling eyes)
  neutral.png      <- emoji_u1f642.png (slightly smiling face)
  low.png          <- emoji_u1f614.png (pensive face)
  stressed.png     <- emoji_u1f60c.png (relieved face)
  celebratory.png  <- emoji_u1f973.png (partying face)
  resolved.png     <- emoji_u2705.png (check mark button)
  night.png        <- emoji_u1f634.png (sleeping face)

No modifications were made to the images themselves beyond renaming.
